.claude_to_do_list.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated at build time
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled from CHANGELOG.md by tools/build-changelog.mjs. Ships in module.zip,
# but committing it would mean two copies of the notes, which is how they drift.
foundry-module/foundryvtt-to-sillytavern-nhp-uplink/changelog.json

